  "description_html": "Skeletal diagram of <i><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Migmanychion\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:Migmanychion\">Migmanychion laiyang</a></i> showing known fossil material. Rib fragments preserved on the holotype slab(s) are not shown due to insufficient data. Scale bar=50 cm.\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Key\">Key</h3></div>\n<p><b style=\"display:inline-block;line-height:1.7;width:1.7em;margin-right:-1px;border:1px solid #808080;background:#FFFFFF\" title=\"#FFFFFF\"> </b>=Holotype <small style=\"font-size:85%;\">(LY 2022JZ3001)</small><br>\n<b style=\"display:inline-block;line-height:1.7;width:1.7em;margin-right:-1px;border:1px solid #808080;background:#8C8C8C\" title=\"#8C8C8C\"> </b>=Unknown\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"References\">References</h3></div>\n<ul><li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cretres.2023.105605\">\"A new theropod dinosaur from the Lower Cretaceous Longjiang Formation of Inner Mongolia (China)\"</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.dinosaur.pref.fukui.jp/archive/memoir/memoir020-001.pdf\">\"Osteology of <i>Fukuivenator paradoxus</i>: a bizarre maniraptoran theropod from the Early Cretaceous of Fukui, Japan\"</a></li></ul>",
